    "summary": "A runner, a rug.  Made from woollen yarns, worked in weft faced tapestry, kilim technique (plied cream wool warp).  Predominantly red, with a broad black border containing geometric motifs in green, turquoise, maroon and beige; in the centre are six stylised stags heads with antlers in black and white (with turquoise) or green and white (with maroon).  Short fringe at each end.",
